{{Quote|text=I smuggled these goods out of the Gotoro Empire. Why do you think they're so expensive?}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC and the merchant of the [[Stardew:Travelling Cart|Travelling Cart]]. She smuggles items from the Gotoran Empire and travels around selling them.

Suki is good friends with [[Olivia]], who purchases Gotoran goods from her due to trade restrictions elsewhere, and [[Stardew:Jas|Jas]], whom she brings gifts for in her visits. She also has a six-year-old daughter at home.
